# Vision-Guided Sorting Workcell: Optical Gantry & Robot Interface Architecture

### 1. Electrical & Optical Subsystem Specifications
* **Industrial Vision Sensor:** Basler ace acA1920-40gm (GigE Vision, Sony IMX249 1/1.2" CMOS, $1920\times1200$, global shutter).
* **Optical Polarization Conditioning:**
  * Polarizer Array ($\mathbf{P}_1$): High-transmission linear polarizing sheets mounted over dual high-output LED bar illuminators ($\theta_{\text{pol}} = 0^\circ$).
  * Camera Analyzer ($\mathbf{P}_2$): High-extinction optical C-mount linear polarizing filter fixed to the 16mm low-distortion lens ($\theta_{\text{ana}} = 90^\circ$).
* **Strobe Controller:** High-speed LED strobe overdrive controller (Gardasoft / CCS) triggered via optocoupled 24V line.
* **Conveyor Motion Encoder:** Autonics E40S6 incremental rotary encoder (1024 PPR, line driver output) coupled to the conveyor drive roller for real-time tracking.
* **Workcell Power Supply:** 24V DC, 10A regulated industrial DIN rail power supply (Mean Well NDR-240-24).

